# OboxSTEAM — Project Context & Domain Reference

> Load this file when working on feature logic, data modelling, routing, roles, or portfolio/subdomain behaviour. For C# API patterns use `coding-style-csharp.mdc`. For the Next.js frontend use `nextjs-engineering-rule.mdc` and `styling-rule.mdc`.

---

## Project Overview

**OboxSTEAM** is a Vietnamese edtech platform that sells and delivers STEAM experiential learning programs (like a leaner Coursera + physical lab sessions). Its distinguishing feature is that every enrolled student automatically builds a **digital Portfolio** — a public microsite documenting their learning journey — which they can use for overseas university applications.

**Core value loop:**
Student enrolls in program → joins a class cohort → learns through online/offline sessions → evidence is collected automatically → AI processes evidence → Portfolio microsite is generated → student shares it with universities

**Repositories:**
- **OboxSTEAM.API** (this repo) — ASP.NET Core 8 REST API, PostgreSQL, AWS integrations
- **OboxSTEAM frontend** (separate repo) — Next.js 16 App Router client

