## Actors & Roles

| Actor | `RoleType` | Key Permissions |
|-------|------------|-----------------|
| **Guest** | — | Browse programs, view public student portfolios |
| **Student** | `Student` | Enroll, learn, track progress, manage own portfolio |
| **Parent** | `Parent` | Register on behalf of child, pay, monitor child's progress (linked sub-profile) |
| **Mentor / Instructor** | `Mentor` | Teach cohort sessions, grade submissions, upload evidence media |
| **Manager** | `Manager` | OboxSTEAM platform representative; oversees program quality and Mentor accounts |
| **Admin** | `SuperAdmin` | System-level observer; manages users, content, AI pipelines |

**Parent–Child linking:** `ParentStudent` join table links parent and student accounts. A parent can manage multiple child sub-profiles. Activity notifications flow to the parent.

**Mentor approval flow:** Mentor registers → uploads CCCD, degree, CV, language cert → Manager reviews → SuperAdmin approves.

