## Enrollment & Progress Tracking

Enrollment creates a **personal curriculum instance** per student.

```
ProgramEnrollment          (student bought / joined a program)
├── ModuleEnrollment       (per module attempt; tracks grade, failures, retakes)
│   ├── ActivityProgress   (lesson completion within this module attempt)
│   ├── Submission         (assignment attempts)
│   └── SessionAttendance  (cohort session attendance)
├── ClassEnrollment        (which cohort the student belongs to)
└── Payment                (program purchase or module retake fee)

CourseEnrollment           (legacy slot tracking — prefer ClassEnrollment + ActivityProgress for new flows)
```

| Entity | Tracks |
|--------|--------|
| **ProgramEnrollment** | Overall program status, progress %, enrolled/started/completed timestamps |
| **ModuleEnrollment** | Module attempt, `FinalGrade`, `AssignmentFailureCount`, retake `AttemptNumber` |
| **ActivityProgress** | Single activity completion within a module enrollment attempt |
| **CourseEnrollment** | Per-course join/start/complete timestamps (older booking model) |

