## Assessments & Quizzes

```
Assignment
├── QuestionBank (optional)     → random draw at serve-time (Easy/Medium/Hard %)
├── QuizQuestion (snapshot)     → frozen questions for a submission attempt
│   └── QuizOption
└── Submission
    ├── QuizAnswer
    ├── SubmissionEvidence → MediaAsset
    └── VerifiedBy (Mentor)
```

- Quiz timer: `Submission.StartedAt` + `Submission.ExpiresAt` from `Assignment.TimeLimitMinutes`
- Manual grading: `AssignedGrade`, `MentorFeedback`, `SubmissionStatus`
- Module pass: assignments with `IsRequiredForModulePass` + all required activities completed

