## Student Profile, Portfolio & Certificates

### Profile data source (`StudentProfile`, `StudentSkill`, `StandardizedTest`)

Academic info, target study-abroad country, GPA, standardized tests, personal statement — raw data for AI portfolio generation.

### Portfolio (`Portfolio`, `PortfolioCustomItem`)

| Plan | `PlanType` | URL format | Features |
|------|------------|-----------|----------|
| Standard (free) | `Standard` | `obox.id/{student-id}` | View online, default templates |
| Premium (paid) | `Premium` | `{subdomain}.obox.id` | PDF export, premium templates, custom branding |

- `Portfolio.Subdomain` — unique slug for premium microsites
- `Portfolio.ParentPortfolioId` — versioned/cloned portfolios

### Certificates (`Certificate`)

Auto-generated PDF on program or module completion. Linked to `ProgramBoard` expert signatures. Feeds portfolio automatically.

