## AI & Media Pipeline

| Entity / Service | Purpose |
|------------------|---------|
| `FaceEmbedding` | Student face vector (AWS Rekognition) for auto-tagging session media |
| `MediaAsset` | Uploaded photos/videos; S3 + MediaConvert + Rekognition job tracking |
| `MediaTag` | Links tagged students to media assets |
| `HighlightVideoStack` / `HighlightVideoItem` | AI-generated personal highlight reels per student per class (stacks of outputs; MediaConvert stitch) |
| Bedrock / Rekognition services | Reflection summarisation, skills analysis, face search, label detection |

> AI logic lives in the **backend**. Frontend consumes results via API only.

