## Domain Entity Index (Backend)

Grouped as registered in `OboxSteamDbContext`:

1. **Users & auth** — `User`, `OtpStorage`, `ParentStudent`
2. **Experts** — `Expert`, `ProgramBoard`
3. **Student profile** — `StudentProfile`, `StudentSkill`, `StandardizedTest`
4. **LMS content** — `Program`, `Module`, `Course`, `Activity`, `Material`
5. **Enrollments** — `ProgramEnrollment`, `ModuleEnrollment`, `CourseEnrollment`, `ActivityBooking`, `ActivityProgress`
6. **Class delivery** — `Class`, `ClassEnrollment`, `ClassSession`, `SessionAttendance`
7. **Assessments** — `Assignment`, `QuestionBank`, `BankQuestion`, `BankQuestionOption`, `QuizQuestion`, `QuizOption`, `QuizAnswer`, `Submission`, `SubmissionEvidence`
8. **Portfolio & certs** — `Certificate`, `Portfolio`, `PortfolioCustomItem`
9. **AI & media** — `FaceEmbedding`, `MediaAsset`, `MediaTag`, `HighlightVideoStack`, `HighlightVideoItem`
10. **Commerce & reviews** — `Payment`, `ProgramReview`

All entities inherit `BaseEntity` (Id, audit fields, soft delete via `IsDeleted` global query filters).

