## Key Conventions

- Enum values are stored as **strings** in PostgreSQL (human-readable, reorder-safe).
- Soft delete: global query filters on most entities; prefer soft delete over hard delete.
- Student data is sensitive — never log PII; secrets via environment variables only.
- STEAM category colors on frontend: `--steam-science`, `--steam-technology`, etc.
- API responses use `ApiResult<T>` wrapper pattern in Application layer.

